Package: spatialfamily
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Statistics and Spatial Econometrics Family for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/spatialfamily
BugReports: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/spatialfamily/issues
Description: Spatial weights from coordinates, boundary files (shapefile, GeoJSON)
    or neighbour lists; global and local spatial autocorrelation (Moran's I,
    Geary's C, Getis-Ord G, LISA, Gi*); spatial regression by maximum likelihood
    (SAR, SEM, SDM, SDEM, SAC, SLX) for cross-sections and fixed-effects panels
    with direct, indirect and total effects; geographically weighted regression;
    industrial agglomeration indices; PPML gravity models; and difference-in-
    differences with spatial spillovers. Written in base R and Matrix.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 2.3.4),
    R6,
    ggplot2,
    Matrix,
    jsonlite
